Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:03.45,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, she wins it in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 她赢得真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:06.42,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁 排名{\fs78}582{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.70,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}孙心然在北京
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:10.27,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}第一次击败世界前{\fs78}50{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:15.13,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}3{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:18.19,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}中网第二轮 孙心然迎战布克沙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:21.86,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}接发这一分 正手直线找到空当
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:29.42,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 她拿到盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.47,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}连续对攻后
