Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:35.94,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 孙心然先拿一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.55,0:00:44.78,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And do we have a big upset on the cards?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N会出现一场大冷门吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:46.54,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}全场{\fs78}5{\fs68}次破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:48.37,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}孙心然拿下{\fs78}4{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:49.96,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}制胜分少于对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:53.27,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}她赢在重要的机会没有白白放过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.87,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}次盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后 她追回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:03.42,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 一记正手直线救下破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:05.80,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}随后保发 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.25,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}来到赛点 布克沙上网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:12.96,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}孙心然用正手穿越
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.35,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}打出了属于自己的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:21.32,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, she wins it in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 她赢得真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:27.64,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it's the biggest victory of this young sixteen-year-old's career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁小将生涯最重要的一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:30.14,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}孙心然说 开场有些紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:31.73,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}后来越来越好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:33.20,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}下一轮对高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:35.72,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}你最想为她哪一分鼓掌？
